<title>DENMARK: Danish Tivoli posts lower H1 1996/97 loss.</title>
<headline>Danish Tivoli posts lower H1 1996/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31 1997</p>
<p>(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result	 minus 50.8 vs minus 53.5</p>
<p> Group net turnover		   23.4 vs 17.0</p>
<p> Group operating result     minus 47.2 vs minus 49.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish amusement park operator is Tivoli A/S. It said in a statement that it expected a full year deficit for 1996/97 but gave no figure. In 1995/96 the park posted a full year 50.8 million crown net loss.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
